      "reasoning": "All my creatures are tapped from paying the waterbend cost, so I have no blockers — but the 11/11 Lieutenant is tapped and not attacking, which was the whole point. The remaining attackers deal 13, leaving me at 1.",
      "thinking": "The opponent attacked with everything except the tapped Earth King's Lieutenant (which I tapped with Patrol's ability). All their attackers are tapped... wait, attackers tap when attacking. Let me look at incoming attackers:\n\
