\n\
My blockers: everything I have is tapped! Foggy Swamp Spirit Keeper (tapped), Humble Merchant (tapped), Spirit Tokens (tapped), Tiger-Seal (tapped). All my creatures are tapped. I can't block anything.\n\
\n\
Wait, this is declare_blockers phase. All my creatures are tapped, so I have no blockers. I'll take 13 damage, going to 1 life. Ouch.\n\
\n\
