        "explanation": "Aang combines an efficient flash flyer with versatile interaction, letting you disrupt a spell or remove a blocker while developing your board. Its transformation adds late-game upside, making it worth the early commitment to white-blue.",
      },
      {
        "seat": "kimik3-max-A",
