        "content": "{\"analysis\":\"Building a blue-black 'draw two cards each turn' deck. The pool has a deep critical mass of second-draw payoffs (Tiger-Seal, Knowledge Seeker, both Messenger Hawks, both Foggy Swamp Spirit Keepers, Otter-Penguin, Foggy Swamp Hunters) and lots of Clue generation plus card draw (Forecasting Fortune Teller, Waterbending Lesson, Spirit Water Revival, Buzzard-Wasp Colony, Teo) to enable them. Teo, Spirited Glider doubles as a flier payoff and loot engine alongside the Hawks, Iguana Parrot, and Buzzard-Wasp. Waterbender Ascension adds another draw engine, and Deadly Precision, Sold Out, and Crashing Wave handle removal, with one Zuko's Conviction for late-game value. Left out: all the white cards (Glider Kids x2, Razor Rings, Airbending Lesson, Avatar Enthusiasts, Jeong Jeong's Deserters) since the fixing is too thin for a splash, plus Kyoshi Battle Fan, Flexible Waterbender, Canyon Crawler, Lost Days, and the second Zuko's Conviction. That's 23 spells; lands come from unlimited basics plus the drafted duals.\",\"decision\":\"accept\",\"chosen_spells\":[\"Tiger-Seal\",\"Callous Inspector\",\"Otter-Penguin\",\"Knowledge Seeker\",\"Forecasting Fortune Teller\",\"Waterbender Ascension\",\"Foggy Swamp Spirit Keeper\",\"Foggy Swamp Spirit Keeper\",\"Pirate Peddlers\",\"Messenger Hawk\",\"Messenger Hawk\",\"Iguana Parrot\",\"North Pole Patrol\",\"Deadly Precision\",\"Spirit Water Revival\",\"Foggy Swamp Hunters\",\"Teo, Spirited Glider\",\"Buzzard-Wasp Colony\",\"Waterbending Lesson\",\"Sold Out\",\"Hama, the Bloodbender\",\"Zuko's Conviction\",\"Crashing Wave\"]}",
