\n\
Actually, let's consider the flying theme: Teo rewards fliers. Fliers: Messenger Hawk x2, Iguana Parrot, Teo, Buzzard-Wasp, Glider Kids x2. If we splash white, Glider Kids adds 2 more fliers. The fixing: North Pole Gates (WU), Misty Palms Oasis (WB), Rumble Arena (any color with 1). That's decent splash potential for a light white splash (Glider Kids is 2W, Razor Rings 1W).\n\
\n\
But splashing with only tapped lands could be awkward. Let me think about how many white sources: North Pole Gates, Misty Palms Oasis, Rumble Arena (technically). That's 3 sources. For a 2W card, that's risky. Maybe just splash Razor Rings (1W) and one Glider Kids? Hmm.\n\
